    <div class="dialogue-box">
        <div class="nameplate">甄嬛</div>

        <div class="dialogue-text">
            （恭敬地行禮）「啓稟皇上，臣妾本名甄玉嬛，乃漢軍旗甄遠道與彭辛蘿之女。」
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 下一句 -->
    <div class="next-btn-wrap">
        <button class="choice-btn" onclick="SugarCube.Engine.play('scene3_2')">下一句</button>
